title "Machine learning pipeline"

store raw: Raw events | warehouse
clean: Clean and join
features: Feature pipeline
store fstore: Feature store
split: Train / validation split
train: Train model | GPU job
eval: Evaluate
ask good: beats production?
register: Model registry
deploy: Canary deploy
serve: Online serving
monitor: Monitor drift
tune: Tune hyperparameters
discard [bad]: Discard run

raw -> clean
clean -> features
features -> fstore
fstore -> split
split -> train
train -> eval
eval -> good
good -> register [ok] : yes
good -> tune [bad] : no
tune -> train : retry
register -> deploy
deploy -> serve
serve -> monitor
monitor -> raw [dashed] : new data
monitor -> train [dashed] : drift detected
good -> discard [dashed] : after 3 tries
fstore -> serve : online features
